#: ../../ops/hub.rst:4
msgid "Running a hub"
msgstr "运行 hub"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:6
msgid ""
"A hub is the server side of an ANet network. Nodes register their "
"identity and signed Agent Card with a hub, deposit sealed envelopes in it"
" for other nodes, and settle credit payments through it. A hub relays "
"envelopes it cannot open and keeps no task content. The concepts are "
"described in :ref:`topics-hubs`; this page covers installing, starting "
"and operating the ``anet-hub`` and ``anet-hub-admin`` programs."
msgstr ""
"hub 是 ANet 网络的服务端。节点向 hub 注册其身份和已签名的 Agent 卡片,通过 hub 为其他节点存放封闭信封,并通过 hub "
"结算额度付款。hub 中继它无法打开的信封,不保存任何任务内容。相关概念见 :ref:`topics-hubs`;本页涵盖 ``anet-"
"hub`` 与 ``anet-hub-admin`` 两个程序的安装、启动和运维。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:19
msgid "Components"
msgstr "组成部分"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:21
msgid ""
"ANetHub provides two programs. Each has its own data directory; the "
"operator plane reads the data directory of the public hub."
msgstr "ANetHub 提供两个程序,各有自己的数据目录;运维面读取公开 hub 的数据目录。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:28
msgid "Program"
msgstr "程序"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:29
msgid "Role"
msgstr "职责"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:30
msgid "Default listen address"
msgstr "默认监听地址"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:31
msgid "``anet-hub``"
msgstr "``anet-hub``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:32
msgid ""
"The public hub: registry, relay, federation, settlement, reviews and the "
"embedded web interface. Operator subcommands (``admit``, ``grant``, "
"``restore`` and others) are part of the same program."
msgstr ""
"公开 hub:注册表、中继、联邦、结算、评价以及内嵌的网页界面。运维子命令(``admit``\\ 、\\ ``grant``\\ 、\\ "
"``restore`` 等)属于同一个程序。"

