msgstr "``127.0.0.1:8078``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:42
msgid ""
"Both programs are static binaries (pure Go, no C library). Nodes need "
"``anet`` 0.3.0 or later to use a hub of this release; ``anet-hub "
"-version`` prints the hub wire version and the node version it requires."
msgstr ""
"两个程序均为静态二进制文件(纯 Go,不依赖 C 库)。节点需要 ``anet`` 0.3.0 或更高版本才能使用本版本的 hub;\\ "
"``anet-hub -version`` 会输出 hub 的线路协议版本以及所要求的节点版本。"

