"``no_federation`` tag:"
msgstr "联邦默认已编译在内。仅在单一组织内部使用、需要完全去除联邦的 hub,使用 ``no_federation`` 标签构建:"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:76
msgid ""
"A ``no_federation`` build has no ``/fed/v3`` routes and no ``clear`` "
