#: ../../ops/hub.rst:81
msgid "Starting a hub"
msgstr "启动 hub"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:83
msgid ""
"A hub listens on a loopback address and is exposed through a reverse "
"proxy that terminates TLS (see :ref:`ops-hub-proxy`)."
msgstr "hub 监听回环地址,通过终结 TLS 的反向代理对外提供服务(参见 :ref:`ops-hub-proxy`)。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:92
msgid ""
"The first start creates the hub's own identity (an AID and a key event "
"log) and the review tag key inside the data directory, and prints their "
"identifiers:"
msgstr "首次启动时,会在数据目录中创建 hub 自身的身份(AID 与密钥事件日志)和评审标签密钥,并输出它们的标识:"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:104
msgid ""
"The hub identity is published at ``GET /hub/identity``. Peer hubs pin it,"
" and the settlement receipts the hub signs verify against it. A hub that "
"has no recovery passphrase prints a notice at every start; see :ref:`ops-"
"hub-recovery`."
msgstr ""
"hub 身份发布在 ``GET /hub/identity``\\ 。对等 hub 会固定它,hub 签发的结算收据也据此验证。尚未设置恢复口令的"
" hub,每次启动都会输出提示;参见 :ref:`ops-hub-recovery`\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:109
msgid ""
"The program stops on ``SIGINT`` or ``SIGTERM``, closing the listener "
"within five seconds."
msgstr "程序在收到 ``SIGINT`` 或 ``SIGTERM`` 时停止,并在五秒内关闭监听。"

