#: ../../ops/hub.rst:209
msgid "Data directories of other releases"
msgstr "其他版本的数据目录"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:211
msgid ""
"Release 0.3.0 migrates no data. A data directory written by 0.2 or "
"earlier is refused with exit status 1 and is left unchanged; move the "
"directory away and start again to create a new identity. A data directory"
" written by a newer ``anet-hub`` is refused as well; upgrade the program "
"and do not delete the directory. A second ``anet-hub`` process on the "
"same data directory is refused for as long as the first one runs."
msgstr ""
"0.3.0 版不迁移任何数据。0.2 或更早版本写入的数据目录会被拒绝,退出状态为 "
"1,目录保持不变;请将该目录移开后重新启动,以创建新的身份。由更新版本的 ``anet-hub`` "
"写入的数据目录同样会被拒绝;请升级程序,不要删除该目录。同一数据目录上的第二个 ``anet-hub`` 进程,在第一个进程运行期间会被拒绝。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:222
msgid "TLS and the reverse proxy"
msgstr "TLS 与反向代理"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:224
msgid ""
"The hub does not terminate TLS. Run it on a loopback address and place a "
"reverse proxy in front. Three requirements apply to the proxy."
msgstr "hub 不终结 TLS。应让它在回环地址上运行,并在前面放置反向代理。代理须满足三项要求。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:227
msgid ""
"**Request-body limit.** The proxy's limit applies before the hub's. Set "
"``client_max_body_size`` to at least the value of ``--relay-max-"
"envelope``."
msgstr ""
"**请求体限制。** 代理的限制先于 hub 的限制生效。请将 ``client_max_body_size`` 设置为不小于 "
"``--relay-max-envelope`` 的值。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:229
msgid ""
"**Client address.** The hub rate-limits registration and enforces its "
"per-network quotas by client address. It reads the address from the ``X"
"-Real-IP`` header. A proxy that does not set this header makes every "
"client share the proxy's bucket."
msgstr ""
"**客户端地址。** hub 按客户端地址对注册限速,并执行按网络划分的配额。它从 ``X-Real-IP`` "
"头读取该地址。未设置此头的代理会使所有客户端共用代理自身的桶。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:233
msgid ""
"**No access log.** Request lines name agents (``/agents/<aid>/...``). A "
"retained access log would reconstruct which address contacted which "
"agent, long after the hub has deleted the envelope. Disable the access "
"log and keep the error log at ``crit``."
msgstr ""
"**不保留访问日志。** 请求行中会出现 Agent(``/agents/<aid>/...``)。保留访问日志,会在 hub "
"删除信封很久之后,仍能还原出哪个地址联系过哪个 Agent。请关闭访问日志,并将错误日志级别保持为 ``crit``\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:238
msgid ""
"The following server block satisfies all three and can be used as a "
"starting point. Certificates are issued here with an ACME client; any "
"other source works equally."
msgstr "下面的 server 块同时满足这三项要求,可作为起点。此处用 ACME 客户端签发证书,其他来源的证书同样可用。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:284
msgid ""
"Plain HTTP is not suitable for a hub reachable from the Internet. Some "
"networks alter unencrypted traffic, and nodes send their registration and"
" mailbox requests to the address they were given."
msgstr "明文 HTTP 不适用于可从互联网访问的 hub。部分网络会篡改未加密的流量,而节点会把注册和邮箱请求发往所获得的地址。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:288
msgid "Verify the installation from another host:"
msgstr "从另一台主机验证安装:"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:297
msgid ""
"A node then joins with ``anet hub-register https://hub.example.com`` (see"
" :ref:`topics-hubs` for the join states a node reports)."
msgstr ""
"之后节点通过 ``anet hub-register https://hub.example.com`` 加入(节点报告的加入状态见 :ref"
":`topics-hubs`)。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:304
msgid "Admission"
msgstr "准入"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:306
msgid ""
"The mode can be set before the hub's first start, for example in a "
"container image or a provisioning script: ``anet-hub --data <dir> "
"admission open --init`` creates the hub data in an existing, empty data "
"directory and sets the mode. Without ``--init`` the command refuses a "
"directory that holds no hub data."
msgstr ""
"准入模式可在 hub 首次启动之前设置，例如在容器镜像或部署脚本中：``anet-hub --data <目录> admission open "
"--init`` 在一个已存在的空数据目录中创建 hub 数据并设置模式。不加 ``--init`` 时，该命令拒绝没有 hub 数据的目录。"

msgid ""
"Admission decides which identities may register. It has two modes, shown "
"and changed with ``anet-hub admission``."
msgstr "准入决定哪些身份可以注册。它有两种模式,可通过 ``anet-hub admission`` 查看和更改。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:309
msgid "``closed``"
msgstr "``closed``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:310
msgid ""
"The mode of a new hub. Only identities on the admission list, and "
"identities arriving during an open sign-up window, may register."
msgstr "新 hub 的模式。只有位于准入名单上的身份,以及在开放注册窗口期间到来的身份,才可注册。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:313
msgid "``open``"
msgstr "``open``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:314
msgid ""
"Any identity may register after passing three gates: a proof of work of "
"22 bits, a daily quota per client network (IPv6 clients are counted per "
"/32), and a 72-hour probation. Registration itself pays no credit; an "
"account that completes its probation receives 20 trial credits, capped "
"per network and by a daily budget for the whole hub. These values are "
"fixed and are the same on every hub. An organisation behind a single "
"address admits identities by AID instead."
msgstr ""
"任何身份通过三道关卡后均可注册:22 位的工作量证明、按客户端网络计的每日配额(IPv6 客户端按 /32 计数),以及 72 "
"小时的试用期。注册本身不支付额度;完成试用期的账户获得 20 个试用额度,并受每个网络的上限和整个 hub 每日预算的限制。这些值是固定的,在所有"
" hub 上相同。位于同一地址之后的组织,应改为按 AID 准入身份。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:329
msgid ""
"Changing the mode affects new registrations only. Registered nodes remain"
" registered."
msgstr "更改模式只影响新的注册。已注册的节点保持注册。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:333
msgid "Admitting an identity"
msgstr "准入身份"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:335
msgid ""
"A node that is not yet admitted prints the command the operator must run "
"(``anet hub-register`` reports the state ``hub_pending_admission`` and "
"retries in the background). The operator admits the AID the node reports:"
msgstr ""
"尚未获准入的节点会输出运维人员须运行的命令(``anet hub-register`` 报告状态 "
"``hub_pending_admission`` 并在后台重试)。运维人员准入节点所报告的 AID:"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:344
msgid "Further forms:"
msgstr "其他形式:"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:353
msgid ""
"``--file`` reads one AID per line. A line that is not a valid AID stops "
"the import and nothing from the file is admitted. A grant is paid once "
"per AID; admitting the same AID again does not pay it again. The command "
"works while the hub is running."
msgstr ""
"``--file`` 每行读取一个 AID。出现无效 AID 的行时,导入中止,文件中的任何 AID 都不会被准入。每个 AID "
"的发放只支付一次;再次准入同一 AID 不会重复支付。该命令可在 hub 运行期间使用。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:359
msgid "Sign-up windows"
msgstr "开放注册窗口"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:361
msgid ""
"A sign-up window admits newcomers without listing their AIDs, for a "
"limited time and number. A window lasts at most 7 days and admits at most"
" 10000 identities. Accounts that join through a window are subject to "
"proof of work and to the 72-hour probation."
msgstr ""
"开放注册窗口可在限定的时间和数量内准入新到者,而无需列出其 AID。窗口最长持续 7 天,最多准入 10000 "
"个身份。通过窗口加入的账户仍须经过工作量证明和 72 小时试用期。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:373
msgid ""
"Only one window can be open at a time. The duration is written as a Go "
"duration (``90m``, ``2h``) or in days (``3d``, ``1d12h``)."
msgstr ""
"同一时间只能开启一个窗口。时长写作 Go 时长格式(``90m``\\ 、\\ ``2h``),或以天计(``3d``\\ 、\\ "
"``1d12h``)。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:377
msgid "Inspecting and revoking"
msgstr "查看与撤销"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:388
msgid ""
"Each line of the list holds the AID, the grant (a trailing ``*`` marks a "
"grant already paid) and the label, separated by tabs, so the list can be "
"edited and fed back to ``admit --file``. Revoking removes the admission "
"and deregisters the account if it is registered; its balance stays on the"
" ledger. On an open hub the identity can register again; revoking is not "
"a ban."
msgstr ""
"列表的每一行包含 AID、发放额度(末尾的 ``*`` 表示已支付)和标签,以制表符分隔,因此可以编辑该列表并回传给 ``admit "
"--file``\\ 。撤销会移除准入,并在账户已注册时注销它;其余额保留在账本上。在 open 模式的 hub "
"上,该身份可以再次注册;撤销并不等于封禁。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:394
msgid ""
"Accounts that have registered but never collected their mail for seven "
"days are deregistered automatically."
msgstr "已注册但连续七天未收取邮件的账户,会被自动注销。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:401
msgid "Quotas for one recipient"
msgstr "单个收件方的配额"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:403
msgid ""
"Every recipient has a share of its mailbox reserved for messages from "
"senders that are not its contacts. The defaults are 30 first contacts per"
" minute, 500 non-contact messages and 64 MiB of non-contact data. An "
"operator can raise these for one AID, for example for a popular public "
"capability; values below the default are refused."
msgstr ""
"每个收件方的邮箱中,都预留了一部分份额,用于接收来自非联系人发送方的消息。默认值为每分钟 30 次首次联系、500 条非联系人消息和 64 MiB"
" 非联系人数据。运维人员可以为某个 AID 调高这些值,例如为广受欢迎的公开能力调高;低于默认值的取值会被拒绝。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:416
msgid ""
"Without options the command shows the current values. The hub applies a "
"change within a minute. A value must be a whole number from 1 to "
"2147483647."
msgstr "不带选项时,该命令显示当前值。hub 在一分钟内应用更改。取值必须是 1 到 2147483647 之间的整数。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:421
msgid "Credits granted by the operator"
msgstr "由运维人员发放的额度"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:428
msgid ""
"The account must be registered on this hub. Issuance, supply and clearing"
" are described in :ref:`ops-facilitator`."
msgstr "账户必须已在本 hub 注册。发行、供给与清算的说明见 :ref:`ops-facilitator`\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:433
msgid "Operator subcommands"
msgstr "运维子命令"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:435
msgid ""
"The operator subcommands open the hub's database directly. All of them "
"accept ``--data DIR`` and read the same data directory the hub runs with."
" Except where noted they work while the hub is running."
msgstr ""
"运维子命令直接打开 hub 的数据库。它们都接受 ``--data DIR``,并读取与 hub 运行时相同的数据目录。除特别说明外,均可在 "
"hub 运行期间使用。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:443
msgid "Subcommand"
msgstr "子命令"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:444
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:445
msgid "``admit``, ``admissions``, ``admission``"
msgstr "``admit``\\ 、\\ ``admissions``\\ 、\\ ``admission``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:446
msgid ""
"Admission list, sign-up windows and registration mode (:ref:`ops-hub-"
"admission`)."
msgstr "准入名单、开放注册窗口和注册模式(:ref:`ops-hub-admission`)。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:448
msgid "``quota <AID>``"
msgstr "``quota <AID>``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:449
msgid "Raise the non-contact quotas of one recipient."
msgstr "调高单个收件方的非联系人配额。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:450
msgid "``grant <AID> --amount N [--reason R]``"
msgstr "``grant <AID> --amount N [--reason R]``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:451
msgid "Issue credits to a registered account."
msgstr "向已注册账户发行额度。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:452
msgid "``supply``"
msgstr "``supply``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:453
msgid ""
"Print issued, redeemed and outstanding credit, the latest published "
"supply epoch, and the amounts due to and owed by peer hubs."
msgstr "输出已发行、已兑付和未清偿的额度、最新发布的供给纪元,以及应付给对等 hub 和对等 hub 应付的数额。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:455
msgid "``due [--json]``"
msgstr "``due [--json]``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:456
msgid "Print what this hub owes each peer hub."
msgstr "输出本 hub 欠各对等 hub 的数额。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:457
msgid "``clear <peer-aid> --amount N [--peer-endpoint URL]``"
msgstr "``clear <peer-aid> --amount N [--peer-endpoint URL]``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:458
msgid ""
"Discharge part of what this hub owes a peer hub. Not available in a "
"``no_federation`` build."
msgstr "清偿本 hub 欠某个对等 hub 的部分债务。\\ ``no_federation`` 构建中不可用。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:460
msgid "``redemptions [--json]``"
msgstr "``redemptions [--json]``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:461
msgid "List the redemptions of the last 14 days."
msgstr "列出最近 14 天的兑付记录。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:462
msgid "``identity status|setup-recovery|rotate``"
msgstr "``identity status|setup-recovery|rotate``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:463
msgid ""
"Inspect and protect the hub identity. ``setup-recovery`` and ``rotate`` "
"require a stopped hub and a terminal."
msgstr "查看并保护 hub 身份。\\ ``setup-recovery`` 和 ``rotate`` 要求 hub 已停止并在终端中运行。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:465
msgid "``restore <backup>``"
msgstr "``restore <backup>``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:466
msgid ""
"Restore the database from a backup. Requires a stopped hub (:ref:`ops-"
"backup`)."
msgstr "从备份恢复数据库。要求 hub 已停止(:ref:`ops-backup`)。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:469
msgid "A subcommand pointed at a directory that holds no hub refuses to run and changes nothing. The subcommands print sentences in the language selected by ``ANET_LANG``: Chinese when the value begins with ``zh`` (any letter case), English otherwise, including when it is unset. ``LC_ALL``, ``LC_MESSAGES`` and ``LANG`` are not consulted. Lists and figures are printed as tab-separated data and are not translated."
msgstr "指向不含 hub 的目录时，子命令会拒绝运行，且不改动任何内容。子命令输出的语句所用的语言由 ``ANET_LANG`` 决定：值以 ``zh`` 开头（不区分大小写）时为中文，否则为英文，未设置时同样为英文。``LC_ALL``、``LC_MESSAGES`` 和 ``LANG`` 不再参与判断。列表和数值以制表符分隔的数据输出，不做翻译。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:479
msgid "Hub identity and recovery passphrase"
msgstr "hub 身份与恢复口令"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:481
msgid ""
"The hub signs settlement receipts, the notices that confirm the key state"
" of its agents, and every request to a peer hub, with its own identity. "
"As for a node identity, the key that will sign next is not stored in the "
"data directory: it is derived from a recovery seed that is encrypted "
"under a passphrase and stored in a recovery file. Until a passphrase is "
"set, a leak of the data directory would allow someone else to take over "
"the hub identity and the operator could not take it back. A hub without a"
" passphrase starts, and prints the following notice at every start and in"
" ``identity status``:"
msgstr ""
"hub 以其自身的身份签发结算收据、确认其 Agent 密钥状态的通知,以及发往对等 hub "
"的每个请求。与节点身份相同,下一个用于签名的密钥并不存放在数据目录中:它由恢复种子派生,恢复种子以口令加密后保存在恢复文件中。在设置口令之前,数据目录一旦泄露,他人就可能接管"
" hub 身份,而运维人员无法夺回。没有口令的 hub 可以启动,并在每次启动时以及 ``identity status`` 中输出如下提示:"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:494
msgid "Set it once, with the hub stopped and from a terminal:"
msgstr "设置一次即可,须在 hub 停止时、于终端中进行:"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:504
msgid ""
"The passphrase needs at least 12 characters and is read from the terminal"
" only; it is never accepted on the command line. The recovery file is "
"written to ``~/.anet-recovery/<last 12 characters of the AID>.anetrec`` "
"of the account that ran the command, or to the path given with "
"``--recovery-file``. The file is useless without the passphrase; store a "
"copy on separate media."
msgstr ""
"口令至少 12 个字符,只从终端读取,从不接受通过命令行传入。恢复文件写入运行该命令的账户的 ``~/.anet-recovery/<AID 的后"
" 12 个字符>.anetrec``,或 ``--recovery-file`` 指定的路径。没有口令时该文件毫无用处;请把副本保存在独立介质上。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:519
msgid ""
"Rotation replaces the hub's signing key. ``identity rotate`` performs one"
" planned rotation; ``--new-recovery`` also replaces the recovery seed and"
" passphrase; ``--emergency`` is for a data directory that may have "
"leaked. It performs the rotation without a grace period for the retired "
"keys, implies ``--new-recovery`` and regenerates the secrets that live in"
" the hub data directory. Secrets that the program cannot replace itself, "
"such as the administration token, are listed for the operator to replace."
msgstr ""
"轮换会替换 hub 的签名密钥。\\ ``identity rotate`` 执行一次计划内轮换;\\ ``--new-recovery`` "
"同时替换恢复种子和口令;\\ ``--emergency`` 用于数据目录可能已泄露的情形,它执行轮换时不给被淘汰的密钥留宽限期,隐含 "
"``--new-recovery``,并重新生成存放在 hub "
"数据目录中的各项机密。程序自身无法替换的机密(例如管理令牌)会被列出,由运维人员自行替换。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:530
msgid "The operator console"
msgstr "运维控制台"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:532
msgid ""
"``anet-hub-admin`` provides the administration console and API for a hub."
" It runs as a separate process beside the public hub and reads the same "
"database. It never reads relay payloads, which the hub itself cannot "
"open, and it holds no channel to any other host."
msgstr ""
"``anet-hub-admin`` 为 hub 提供管理控制台和 API。它作为独立进程与公开 hub "
"并行运行,读取同一个数据库。它从不读取中继载荷(hub 自身也无法打开这些载荷),也不与任何其他主机建立通道。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:553
msgid "Listen address. Keep it on loopback; a reverse proxy publishes it."
msgstr "监听地址。请保持为回环地址,由反向代理对外发布。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:554
msgid "``--hub-data``"
msgstr "``--hub-data``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:555
#: ../../ops/hub.rst:558
msgid "required in practice"
msgstr "实际必填"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:556
msgid "The public hub's data directory (``hub.db``)."
msgstr "公开 hub 的数据目录(``hub.db``)。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:559
msgid ""
"The operator plane's own data directory (``admin.db``, "
"``officials.json``)."
msgstr "运维面自身的数据目录(``admin.db``\\ 、\\ ``officials.json``)。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:561
msgid "``--base``"
msgstr "``--base``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:562
msgid "``/admin``"
msgstr "``/admin``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:563
msgid "URL base path."
msgstr "URL 基础路径。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:564
msgid "``--snapshot-every``"
msgstr "``--snapshot-every``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:565
msgid "``5m``"
msgstr "``5m``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:566
msgid "Interval of statistics snapshots; ``0`` turns them off."
msgstr "统计快照的间隔;\\ ``0`` 表示关闭。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:567
msgid "``--check-token``"
msgstr "``--check-token``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:569
msgid ""
"Apply the start-up rules to ``$ADMIN_TOKEN``, exit with status 0 or 1 and"
" print no value. Deployment scripts use it before a restart."
msgstr "对 ``$ADMIN_TOKEN`` 应用启动规则,以状态 0 或 1 退出,不输出任何值。部署脚本在重启前使用它。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:575
msgid ""
"The built-in defaults of ``--hub-data`` and ``--data`` are paths of one "
"reference deployment and are unlikely to exist on another host. Pass both"
" options explicitly."
msgstr "``--hub-data`` 与 ``--data`` 的内置默认值是某个参考部署的路径,在其他主机上很可能不存在。请显式传入这两个选项。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:580
msgid "The operator token"
msgstr "运维令牌"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:582
msgid ""
"The token is read from the ``ADMIN_TOKEN`` environment variable and has "
"no default. An unset or empty token, or a placeholder such as "
"``CHANGE_ME``, stops the start. A token that appears in the project's "
"published source is accepted, but the process logs a warning at start and"
" every hour. Generate a random token of at least 32 hexadecimal "
"characters and keep it in a file readable by the service account only "
"(see :ref:`ops-deployment`)."
msgstr ""
"令牌从环境变量 ``ADMIN_TOKEN`` 读取,没有默认值。令牌未设置或为空,或为 ``CHANGE_ME`` "
"之类的占位值时,启动中止。出现在项目已发布源码中的令牌虽会被接受,但进程会在启动时以及此后每小时记录一条警告。请生成至少 32 "
"个十六进制字符的随机令牌,并保存在仅服务账户可读的文件中(参见 :ref:`ops-deployment`)。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:596
msgid "Login and API access"
msgstr "登录与 API 访问"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:598
msgid ""
"The console page at ``/admin`` is public; the login happens inside it. "
"The API under ``/admin/api`` is available only with the token as a bearer"
" credential. Failed credential checks, from the login route and from "
"bearer authentication alike, are limited to 20 per client address per "
"minute; further attempts receive ``429``. Requests that carry no "
"credential are answered with ``401``."
msgstr ""
"``/admin`` 的控制台页面是公开的,登录在页面内完成。\\ ``/admin/api`` 下的 API 仅在以令牌作为 bearer "
"凭证时可用。无论来自登录路由还是 bearer 认证,凭证校验失败每个客户端地址每分钟最多 20 次;超出后收到 ``429``\\ "
"。不带凭证的请求返回 ``401``\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:613
msgid ""
"The remote address is taken from ``X-Real-IP`` when present, so publish "
"the console only through a proxy that sets this header. A location block "
"for the console, to be placed in the TLS server block before ``location "
"/``:"
msgstr ""
"远程地址在存在时取自 ``X-Real-IP``,因此控制台只应通过设置了该头的代理发布。控制台的 location 块如下,应放置在 TLS "
"server 块中 ``location /`` 之前:"

