msgstr "``GET /agents[?q=&tier=]``\\ 、\\ ``GET /agents/{aid}``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:642
msgid ""
"Registered agents, including agents that are not listed publicly, with "
"review counts and mailbox backlog (a row count; payloads are not read)."
msgstr "已注册的 Agent(包括未公开列出的 Agent),附评价数量和邮箱积压量(行数;不读取载荷)。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:645
#, python-brace-format
