#: ../../ops/hub.rst:648
msgid ""
"Revoke the admission of the agent and deregister it. The balance stays on"
" the ledger. On an open hub the agent can register again."
msgstr "撤销该 Agent 的准入并注销它。余额保留在账本上。在 open 模式的 hub 上,该 Agent 可以再次注册。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:650
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``GET /official``, ``POST /official``, ``DELETE /official/{id}``"
msgstr "``GET /official``\\ 、\\ ``POST /official``\\ 、\\ ``DELETE /official/{id}``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:651
msgid ""
"Register of official agents (``id``, ``aid``, ``hub``, ``caps`` and "
"descriptive labels)."
msgstr "官方 Agent 登记簿(``id``\\ 、\\ ``aid``\\ 、\\ ``hub``\\ 、\\ ``caps`` 以及描述性标签)。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:653
msgid "``GET /capabilities``, ``GET /discover``"
msgstr "``GET /capabilities``\\ 、\\ ``GET /discover``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:654
msgid "Capabilities of registered agents."
msgstr "已注册 Agent 的能力。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:655
msgid "``GET /reviews``"
msgstr "``GET /reviews``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:656
msgid "Reviews as rating, comment and receipt CID only."
msgstr "评价,仅含评分、评论和收据 CID。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:657
msgid "``GET /audit``"
msgstr "``GET /audit``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:658
msgid "Audit trail of every administrative action."
msgstr "所有管理操作的审计记录。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:659
msgid "``GET /admission``"
msgstr "``GET /admission``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:660
msgid ""
"The registration mode, the sign-up window, the accounts by the way in "
"which they were admitted, the accounts on probation, the recipients whose"
" quota was raised, and the fixed rules of the hub (bits of the proof of "
"work, length of the probation, trial credits, daily limits)."
msgstr ""
"注册模式、注册窗口、按准入方式分类的账户、处于见习期的账户、配额被调高的接收方，以及 hub "
"的固定规则（工作量证明的位数、见习期长度、体验额度、每日限额）。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:664
msgid "``GET /delivery``"
msgstr "``GET /delivery``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:665
msgid ""
"Counters of delivery confirmation: queued envelopes, confirmations held, "
"tracked redeliveries, and the retention and capacity of confirmations. No"
" message and no confirmation is read."
msgstr "送达确认的计数：排队的信封、持有的确认、被跟踪的重投，以及确认的保存期与容量。不读取任何消息，也不读取任何确认。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:668
msgid "``GET /federation``"
msgstr "``GET /federation``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:669
msgid ""
"The peer hubs from which this hub has learned agents, with the number of "
"agents, the number withdrawn, the time of the last card, and the net "
"amounts that the two hubs owe each other."
msgstr "本 hub 从中学到 agent 的对等 hub，包括 agent 数量、已撤回数量、最近一张卡片的时间，以及两个 hub 相互欠款的净额。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:672
msgid "``GET /deleted``"
msgstr "``GET /deleted``"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:673
msgid ""
"Deleted accounts, with ``?format=admit`` producing a list that ``anet-hub"
" admit --file`` accepts, which undoes a batch of deletions."
msgstr ""
"已删除的账户;加上 ``?format=admit`` 会生成可供 ``anet-hub admit --file`` "
"接受的列表,用于撤销一批删除。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:676
msgid ""
"There is no route that restores a deleted registration from an archive, "
"because that would write an old key history back into the registry. To "
"undo a deletion, run ``anet-hub admit <AID>``; the node re-registers the "
"next time ``anet hub-register`` runs. Other paths under ``/admin/api/`` "
"answer ``404`` with a JSON body after authentication. The console itself "
"is served as a single page. ``GET /admin/healthz`` reports the version, "
"commit and build time of the operator plane without authentication, so "
"that a deployment can confirm which build is running."
msgstr ""
"没有从归档恢复已删除注册的路由,因为这会把旧的密钥历史写回注册表。要撤销删除,请运行 ``anet-hub admit "
"<AID>``;节点会在下次运行 ``anet hub-register`` 时重新注册。\\ ``/admin/api/`` "
"下的其他路径在认证之后返回 ``404`` 和 JSON 正文。控制台本身以单页形式提供。\\ ``GET /admin/healthz`` "
"无需认证即可报告运维面的版本、提交和构建时间,使部署可以确认正在运行的是哪个构建。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:685
msgid ""
"The official-agent register is read at start from ``officials.json`` in "
"the operator plane's data directory; a missing file means no official "
"agents. An entry that still carries ``runtime``, ``monitor``, ``ops`` or "
"``datasets`` fields is refused, and the process does not start. The "
"operator plane starts, stops or updates no agent; those tasks belong to "
"separate tooling outside the hub host."
msgstr ""
"官方 Agent 登记簿在启动时从运维面数据目录中的 ``officials.json`` 读取;文件不存在表示没有官方 Agent。仍带有 "
"``runtime``\\ 、\\ ``monitor``\\ 、\\ ``ops`` 或 ``datasets`` "
"字段的条目会被拒绝,进程无法启动。运维面不启动、停止或更新任何 Agent;这些工作由 hub 主机之外的独立工具负责。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:692
msgid ""
"The console is a single page with a navigation column and seven sections:"
" overview, nodes, registrations, federation, settlement and audit, "
"admission and quotas, and logs. The tables can be sorted and filtered. "
"The sections for admission, delivery confirmation and federation show the"
" read-only routes above; the console has no page for an interface that "
"0.3 removed. The console can be used with the keyboard and has a light "
"and a dark theme."
msgstr ""
"控制台是单页界面，带有导航栏和七个部分：概览、节点、注册、联邦、结算与审计、准入与配额、日志。表格可以排序和过滤。准入、送达确认和联邦部分显示上述只读路由；控制台没有针对"
" 0.3 已移除接口的页面。控制台可用键盘操作，并有浅色和深色两种主题。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:699
msgid ""
"Two options of earlier releases, ``--restore-agents-from`` and ``--keep-"
"only-agents``, are removed. Each is refused with exit status 2 and names "
"its replacement (``anet-hub restore`` and the console's delete function "
"or ``anet-hub admissions revoke``)."
msgstr ""
"早期版本的两个选项 ``--restore-agents-from`` 和 ``--keep-only-agents`` "
"已移除。使用它们会被拒绝,退出状态为 2,并提示替代方式(``anet-hub restore``,以及控制台的删除功能或 ``anet-hub "
"admissions revoke``)。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:706
msgid "Upgrading a hub"
msgstr "升级 hub"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:708
msgid "Take a backup (:ref:`ops-backup`)."
msgstr "先做备份(:ref:`ops-backup`)。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:709
msgid "Stop the service."
msgstr "停止服务。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:710
msgid ""
"Replace the binaries. Replace ``anet-hub-admin`` in the same step; the "
"operator plane refuses a hub data directory written by a newer release."
msgstr "替换二进制文件。请同时替换 ``anet-hub-admin``;运维面会拒绝由更新版本写入的 hub 数据目录。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:712
msgid "Start the service and check ``/healthz`` for the new version."
msgstr "启动服务,并检查 ``/healthz`` 返回的是新版本。"

#: ../../ops/hub.rst:714
msgid ""
"Release 0.3.0 uses hub wire 3. A node that declares an older wire version"
" is refused with status ``426`` and the reason ``wire_too_old``, which "
"names the required wire version and node release; they cannot use a 0.3.0"
" hub, and a 0.3.0 node does not use an older hub."
msgstr ""
"0.3.0 使用 hub 线路协议第 3 版。声明较旧线路协议版本的节点会被拒绝,状态为 ``426``,原因码为 "
"``wire_too_old``,其中给出所需的线路协议版本和节点版本;这类节点无法使用 0.3.0 的 hub,0.3.0 的节点也不使用较旧的"
" hub。"

